WEBVTT

00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:11.070
I'm late!

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:13.570
I've gotta hurry! Gotta hurry!

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:15.900
Here's a shortcut!

00:00:28.630 --> 00:00:30.210
Hey, what's wrong, Doggy?

00:00:31.550 --> 00:00:33.340
I'll just—

00:00:34.190 --> 00:00:36.760
I hope Akane can make it...

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:38.730
Why isn't she with us?

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:44.890
Deliveries took longer than usual because the newspapers were late after the chaos of the other day.

00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:47.270
It's our first day at our new school, too...

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:49.820
I hope she's going to be on time.

00:00:55.280 --> 00:00:56.700
There she is!

00:00:57.220 --> 00:00:59.040
She transformed!

00:02:42.040 --> 00:02:43.320
S-She's so skillful.

00:02:47.960 --> 00:02:51.820
You're going to win the national tournament again with that approach.

00:02:52.200 --> 00:02:53.830
All the best, Saegusa.

00:02:55.030 --> 00:02:56.030
Thank you.

00:02:56.560 --> 00:02:58.580
On the honor of the Natural Harmony School,

00:02:58.620 --> 00:03:02.120
I swear not to lose to any of my opponents.

00:03:11.550 --> 00:03:13.050
What's... that?

00:03:15.550 --> 00:03:18.720
Awesome. I think I'll make it in time!

00:03:24.560 --> 00:03:26.610
Oh, damn!

00:03:32.280 --> 00:03:35.830
Ouch... Should've paid more attention.

00:03:37.700 --> 00:03:38.330
Intruder!

00:03:40.750 --> 00:03:42.040
Chesto!

00:03:45.540 --> 00:03:49.550
She dodged the first strike of the Natural Harmony school...

00:03:51.010 --> 00:03:52.800
What's wrong with you?!

00:03:52.800 --> 00:03:56.050
You're no mere intruder,

00:03:56.050 --> 00:03:58.560
but you won't evade the next one.

00:03:59.850 --> 00:04:01.310
Natural Harmony style, secret move: Mountain...

00:04:02.310 --> 00:04:04.060
Cutter!

00:04:11.240 --> 00:04:11.740
Sorry!

00:04:12.780 --> 00:04:16.160
Uh... I'm really sorry!

00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:23.900
I lost...

00:04:24.920 --> 00:04:26.000
I was defeated...

00:04:35.090 --> 00:04:36.510
That caught me off guard.

00:04:36.760 --> 00:04:38.510
What are you doing, Isshiki?!

00:04:40.390 --> 00:04:45.150
I suppose it couldn't remain a secret forever.

00:04:46.310 --> 00:04:51.610
Well, I'm just glad the girls could escape the limelight.

00:04:52.450 --> 00:04:57.330
You made it seem as if the struggle of the Allied Forces carried the day...

00:04:58.910 --> 00:05:00.870
As if merely struggling would defeat an Alone...

00:05:01.250 --> 00:05:03.120
I'd like to discuss the Alone.

00:05:03.120 --> 00:05:09.130
Analysis has confirmed that it was utilizing the Manifestor Engine's output.

00:05:09.590 --> 00:05:13.380
It was also heading straight for the Engine.

00:05:13.880 --> 00:05:17.180
Is it their aim to leech energy from it?

00:05:17.180 --> 00:05:20.350
Or are they trying to destroy the Engine itself?

00:05:20.680 --> 00:05:28.020
Whichever the case, we can't shut down the Engine now that it provides 95% of the world's energy consumption.

00:05:28.320 --> 00:05:32.360
Professor, just what are these Alones?

00:05:32.360 --> 00:05:37.080
What would happen if they made it to the Manifestor Engine?

00:05:37.780 --> 00:05:40.540
No one knows the answer to that question.

00:05:40.870 --> 00:05:45.630
All I can say for certain is the incident from back then will pale in comparison.

00:05:48.500 --> 00:05:49.960
Professor...

00:05:49.960 --> 00:05:51.050
What?

00:05:51.720 --> 00:05:54.640
How on Earth did you end up in that body?

00:05:57.050 --> 00:05:58.310
Good grief!

00:05:58.310 --> 00:06:01.730
If this were the army, we'd have already put you on extra duty!

00:06:01.730 --> 00:06:03.060
I'm sorry.

00:06:03.560 --> 00:06:06.770
You're big military secrets!

00:06:06.770 --> 00:06:09.030
We can't just let everyone know your true identities.

00:06:09.030 --> 00:06:12.530
Don't use your jet suits to come to school!

00:06:12.780 --> 00:06:16.320
Um... I think I already blew my cover.

00:06:16.740 --> 00:06:19.490
What?! Who saw you?!

00:06:19.490 --> 00:06:21.040
A girl in kendo robes.

00:06:21.040 --> 00:06:23.170
She was really good.

00:06:23.420 --> 00:06:27.000
She must've been Saegusa Wakaba.

00:06:27.290 --> 00:06:28.840
Saegusa?

00:06:28.840 --> 00:06:33.930
She's the class representative for 2/A, which is where you're headed.

00:06:33.930 --> 00:06:35.220
Her, of all people...

00:06:35.890 --> 00:06:38.560
She's also the captain of the girls' kendo team,

00:06:38.560 --> 00:06:42.390
and last year she won at the nationals while only a freshman.

00:06:42.390 --> 00:06:44.230
She's a bright student with excellent grades.

00:06:44.690 --> 00:06:47.400
She's the pride and joy of the entire school.

00:06:47.400 --> 00:06:49.070
Wow!

00:06:52.990 --> 00:06:55.160
<i>What a fearsome foe.</i>

00:06:55.160 --> 00:06:59.040
<i>To my knowledge, nobody at this school is as capable.</i>

00:06:59.790 --> 00:07:00.830
Look, she's here!

00:07:00.830 --> 00:07:02.410
There's our new teacher!

00:07:03.370 --> 00:07:05.500
I'm sure you've been told this already,

00:07:05.500 --> 00:07:08.380
but for certain reasons I'll be your homeroom teacher from now on.

00:07:08.380 --> 00:07:09.880
I'm Amagi Mizuha.

00:07:09.880 --> 00:07:11.720
Nice to meet you.

00:07:11.920 --> 00:07:14.430
So, do you think those reasons have anything to do with the monster?

00:07:15.140 --> 00:07:18.560
<i>This is a stain on the honor of the Natural Harmony school...</i>

00:07:18.560 --> 00:07:19.770
<i>I must rid myself of this shame...</i>

00:07:20.270 --> 00:07:24.730
Now then, let me introduce you to two new classmates from Oshima.

00:07:25.650 --> 00:07:26.310
Come in.

00:07:33.030 --> 00:07:34.860
I'm Isshiki Akane.

00:07:34.860 --> 00:07:36.370
I am Futaba Aoi.

00:07:36.370 --> 00:07:38.290
Pleased to meet you!

00:07:38.580 --> 00:07:41.460
<i>She looks just like the intruder this morning!</i>

00:07:42.710 --> 00:07:45.920
All right, sit down over there.

00:07:45.920 --> 00:07:46.420
Okay.

00:07:46.420 --> 00:07:49.300
<i>That's definitely Saegusa...</i>

00:07:52.130 --> 00:07:53.010
<i>They look so alike.</i>

00:07:54.180 --> 00:07:56.510
<i>She's staring at me...</i>

00:07:59.310 --> 00:08:01.270
<i>She keeps staring at me...</i>

00:08:03.940 --> 00:08:04.980
Who's that?

00:08:05.520 --> 00:08:07.770
That's Himawari. Just ignore her.

00:08:07.770 --> 00:08:09.570
Himawari?

00:08:10.940 --> 00:08:13.280
Nice to meet you, Himawari!

00:08:16.780 --> 00:08:18.080
<i>They look the same!</i>

00:08:25.960 --> 00:08:28.210
We've got a nice and interesting class, don't you agree?

00:08:28.210 --> 00:08:33.340
Yeah, but Saegusa kept staring at me. I was kind of scared.

00:08:33.340 --> 00:08:35.220
That is an awful lot of calories.

00:08:37.140 --> 00:08:39.310
You're not an ordinary girl, after all.

00:08:39.310 --> 00:08:41.270
Uh...

00:08:41.270 --> 00:08:43.560
I don't believe I've introduced myself yet, have I?

00:08:44.150 --> 00:08:48.780
I am Saegusa Wakaba, heir apparent to the Natural Harmony School.

00:08:48.780 --> 00:08:51.320
Nice to meet you, Saegusa!

00:08:53.020 --> 00:08:57.080
Isshiki Akane, were you the intruder in red this morning?

00:08:57.280 --> 00:08:58.790
Intruder?

00:08:58.790 --> 00:09:01.500
I don't know what you're talking about.

00:09:02.410 --> 00:09:03.580
Don't play dumb!

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:06.290
I let my guard down this morning.

00:09:06.290 --> 00:09:07.630
I did not lose!

00:09:07.630 --> 00:09:09.340
Saegusa?

00:09:09.920 --> 00:09:12.340
On the honor of the School of Natural Harmony,

00:09:13.050 --> 00:09:14.340
let us finish this!

00:09:18.600 --> 00:09:21.600
I refuse!

00:09:21.600 --> 00:09:22.810
Wait!

00:09:23.940 --> 00:09:26.020
She's chasing me!

00:09:28.150 --> 00:09:29.570
Her movements...

00:09:29.570 --> 00:09:30.360
I'm sure of it!

00:09:39.120 --> 00:09:41.750
Not half bad, Isshiki Akane!

00:09:44.710 --> 00:09:47.210
Don't run in the hallway!

00:09:47.210 --> 00:09:48.710
Sorry!

00:09:52.010 --> 00:09:53.260
Darn.

00:09:53.260 --> 00:09:55.390
Are you okay?

00:09:55.390 --> 00:09:56.800
Let me help!

00:09:56.800 --> 00:09:58.430
Thank you.

00:10:01.730 --> 00:10:05.190
That helped a lot. Thank you.

00:10:06.770 --> 00:10:08.230
Okay! En garde!

00:10:09.150 --> 00:10:11.690
Lay off!

00:10:13.990 --> 00:10:15.000
Akane?

00:10:16.070 --> 00:10:17.030
Momo!

00:10:17.030 --> 00:10:18.200
What are you doing?

00:10:18.540 --> 00:10:19.950
Thank God you're here!

00:10:19.950 --> 00:10:21.890
Delay Saegusa for me!

00:10:22.410 --> 00:10:23.330
Please!

00:10:23.330 --> 00:10:25.790
Hey, what—

00:10:25.790 --> 00:10:26.990
Hold it!

00:10:29.840 --> 00:10:31.800
Ouch!

00:10:32.260 --> 00:10:33.760
I am so sorry!

00:10:33.760 --> 00:10:34.800
Are you okay?

00:10:36.760 --> 00:10:37.510
Oh, my!

00:10:38.850 --> 00:10:41.480
Wha— I'm fine!

00:10:41.480 --> 00:10:44.270
No! You have to get that looked at!

00:10:48.480 --> 00:10:49.730
Akane!

00:10:50.610 --> 00:10:51.840
Aoi!

00:10:52.030 --> 00:10:53.280
I was looking for you!

00:10:54.030 --> 00:10:55.030
We've got a problem!

00:10:55.030 --> 00:10:56.660
She took Momo!

00:10:59.040 --> 00:11:00.290
Are you okay?

00:11:00.290 --> 00:11:01.580
Does it hurt anywhere else?

00:11:01.870 --> 00:11:04.000
No, I'm fine.

00:11:04.080 --> 00:11:05.580
I'm really, really sorry!

00:11:06.250 --> 00:11:09.340
I get tunnel vision when I'm worked up.

00:11:09.760 --> 00:11:12.340
Don't worry about it...

00:11:14.640 --> 00:11:16.140
Are you in one of the elementary school classes?

00:11:16.350 --> 00:11:17.810
I haven't seen you around before.

00:11:17.810 --> 00:11:20.470
I transferred here from Oshima today.

00:11:21.100 --> 00:11:22.060
From Oshima?

00:11:23.230 --> 00:11:25.730
I heard your school was reduced to rubble.

00:11:25.900 --> 00:11:27.150
That must have been horrible.

00:11:27.360 --> 00:11:28.310
Yeah...

00:11:28.520 --> 00:11:32.310
But I can manage, because everyone here is so kind.

00:11:32.860 --> 00:11:34.010
I see...

00:11:34.160 --> 00:11:36.810
If you need anything, just ask me!

00:11:36.950 --> 00:11:38.540
I'll be there to help!

00:11:39.660 --> 00:11:41.500
You're just like my sister.

00:11:41.500 --> 00:11:42.790
Your sister?

00:11:42.790 --> 00:11:44.420
Oh, never mind.

00:11:46.420 --> 00:11:49.310
Are those straps popular in Oshima?

00:11:50.550 --> 00:11:53.680
My sister... gave them to me...

00:11:54.890 --> 00:11:56.430
What's your name?

00:11:58.600 --> 00:12:00.430
Isshiki Momo...

00:12:01.020 --> 00:12:04.190
So, you are Isshiki Akane's...

00:12:04.480 --> 00:12:06.440
Little sister.

00:12:07.480 --> 00:12:10.570
Please, talk to your sister!

00:12:11.780 --> 00:12:14.820
I want to fight her!

00:12:14.820 --> 00:12:16.070
I have to!

00:12:16.410 --> 00:12:17.080
Please!

00:12:18.660 --> 00:12:22.040
Why do you want to fight her so badly?

00:12:23.040 --> 00:12:28.920
I cannot allow a loss to stain the honor of the Natural Harmony School!

00:12:35.930 --> 00:12:37.000
Akane...

00:12:44.850 --> 00:12:47.440
Saegusa was really serious about it.

00:12:47.690 --> 00:12:48.770
I know.

00:12:49.440 --> 00:12:52.740
I think she's a very nice person, too.

00:12:52.740 --> 00:12:54.070
I know.

00:12:56.160 --> 00:13:01.250
But if I fight her, they'll find out I transformed.

00:13:01.250 --> 00:13:03.240
That won't be good.

00:13:06.210 --> 00:13:08.300
Hey, don't hog the bathtub.

00:13:19.350 --> 00:13:21.930
You trained with great zeal today.

00:13:22.690 --> 00:13:26.060
I still have a long way to go before I can reach you, Father.

00:13:26.770 --> 00:13:31.360
And today, I was reminded of my own weaknesses.

00:13:32.820 --> 00:13:36.410
How do I get stronger, Father?

00:13:38.990 --> 00:13:42.660
You need to learn what true strength is.

00:13:42.660 --> 00:13:44.580
True strength?

00:13:44.960 --> 00:13:47.540
Wakaba, you're strong,

00:13:47.540 --> 00:13:51.090
but winning alone does not make one truly strong.

00:13:51.670 --> 00:13:59.470
The true warrior knows when and how to use their power.

00:13:59.970 --> 00:14:04.650
Once you can understand that, you will improve.

00:14:12.450 --> 00:14:13.820
What's wrong?

00:14:13.820 --> 00:14:16.910
Do I have to run away from Saegusa today as well?

00:14:18.160 --> 00:14:19.830
Huh? What's this?

00:14:21.910 --> 00:14:24.870
Akane, that's a love letter!

00:14:26.420 --> 00:14:29.500
Congratulations! I'll make hamburgers today!

00:14:29.500 --> 00:14:30.460
Momo...

00:14:32.800 --> 00:14:34.220
What a pretty envelope.

00:14:34.220 --> 00:14:36.180
It's so cute—?

00:14:36.760 --> 00:14:37.550
Huh?

00:14:37.550 --> 00:14:39.010
What's this?

00:14:39.010 --> 00:14:41.230
A challenge?

00:14:42.640 --> 00:14:44.480
<i>Lady Isshiki Akane,</i>

00:14:44.480 --> 00:14:45.900
<i>I hereby challenge you to a duel.</i>

00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:49.190
<i>Meet me on the sandy beach behind the school once classes end.</i>

00:14:49.190 --> 00:14:50.690
<i>I will await your arrival.</i>

00:14:50.690 --> 00:14:53.320
<i>Natural Harmony School, Saegusa Wakaba.</i>

00:14:55.700 --> 00:14:56.780
You've come.

00:15:01.700 --> 00:15:02.960
Put that on.

00:15:03.290 --> 00:15:04.540
I don't need it.

00:15:04.540 --> 00:15:06.210
You don't use armor either, do you?

00:15:07.130 --> 00:15:09.460
Don't complain if you get hurt.

00:15:10.050 --> 00:15:11.050
I won't.

00:15:12.260 --> 00:15:13.930
Sis...

00:15:13.930 --> 00:15:15.010
Akane...

00:15:28.020 --> 00:15:29.560
Sideways disarm!

00:15:29.560 --> 00:15:29.570
<i>Crap!</i>
Sideways disarm!

00:15:29.570 --> 00:15:30.900
<i>Crap!</i>

00:15:30.900 --> 00:15:32.780
Got you!

00:15:34.740 --> 00:15:38.580
That won't work again!

00:15:48.170 --> 00:15:49.300
<i>Two swords?!</i>

00:15:49.300 --> 00:15:50.050
<i>She's fast!</i>

00:15:58.560 --> 00:15:59.720
<i>Without even looking?!</i>

00:16:00.890 --> 00:16:02.730
<i>She's insane!</i>

00:16:03.230 --> 00:16:04.350
<i>But...</i>

00:16:04.350 --> 00:16:06.940
You're good, Isshiki Akane!

00:16:12.240 --> 00:16:14.570
<i>What's this feeling?</i>

00:16:14.820 --> 00:16:15.910
<i>Oh, that's right.</i>

00:16:15.910 --> 00:16:21.080
<i>This is how it felt when I first started kendo as a little girl.</i>

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:23.620
<i>I'd forgotten this feeling!</i>

00:16:27.960 --> 00:16:29.090
This isn't over!

00:16:31.300 --> 00:16:32.590
I hope so!

00:16:33.680 --> 00:16:35.090
What should we do?

00:16:35.680 --> 00:16:38.850
We can't just... leave them there...

00:16:38.850 --> 00:16:40.350
Wait, Momo.

00:16:41.850 --> 00:16:43.100
Look.

00:16:43.560 --> 00:16:46.110
Akane's smiling.

00:16:46.110 --> 00:16:48.110
This is fun, Wakaba!

00:16:51.280 --> 00:16:56.280
Will you fight me again, regardless of the outcome here?

00:16:57.370 --> 00:16:58.660
Of course!

00:16:58.660 --> 00:17:00.160
I mean, we—

00:17:01.540 --> 00:17:02.830
What's going on?

00:17:12.800 --> 00:17:14.630
What's that?

00:17:14.630 --> 00:17:15.590
An Alone!

00:17:16.300 --> 00:17:17.050
Alone?

00:17:17.680 --> 00:17:18.850
I'm sorry, Wakaba.

00:17:18.850 --> 00:17:20.180
We'll have to postpone this fight.

00:17:20.180 --> 00:17:21.060
Run now! Quick!

00:17:21.430 --> 00:17:23.560
Run? What?

00:17:23.560 --> 00:17:25.310
You should take shelter, too!

00:17:25.310 --> 00:17:27.060
Akane!

00:17:27.060 --> 00:17:28.900
Sis!

00:17:28.900 --> 00:17:31.070
I have to go.

00:17:31.070 --> 00:17:32.320
Go where?!

00:17:33.280 --> 00:17:35.410
There's a fight I have to win, too!

00:17:36.410 --> 00:17:37.660
You have to win?

00:17:39.200 --> 00:17:41.080
Saegusa, take care of Momo!

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:43.580
Isshiki! And Futaba too?!

00:17:43.920 --> 00:17:45.500
Let's go, Aoi!

00:17:51.590 --> 00:17:53.220
Why did she say she had to win?

00:17:53.220 --> 00:17:55.510
How could she win against <i>that</i>?!

00:17:55.510 --> 00:17:56.470
They'll win!

00:17:57.300 --> 00:18:00.850
They'll definitely win, to save us all!

00:18:01.680 --> 00:18:02.680
To save us...

00:18:04.560 --> 00:18:11.990
The true warrior knows when and how to use their power.

00:18:13.070 --> 00:18:17.370
I see, so this is true strength!

00:18:17.370 --> 00:18:22.370
Precisely! The power of friendship will persevere!

00:18:24.540 --> 00:18:27.000
Please excuse my grandfather.

00:18:31.670 --> 00:18:34.430
Naked Impact!

00:18:40.520 --> 00:18:41.480
Aoi!

00:18:41.480 --> 00:18:42.940
I'm okay!

00:18:46.520 --> 00:18:47.980
Momo! Saegusa!

00:18:50.940 --> 00:18:52.320
Saegusa!

00:18:52.400 --> 00:18:53.320
Are you hurt?

00:18:53.610 --> 00:18:55.160
Are you okay?

00:18:56.620 --> 00:18:58.280
I thought I was done for.

00:18:58.280 --> 00:18:59.540
Gramps!

00:18:59.540 --> 00:19:01.040
Why are you here?

00:19:01.040 --> 00:19:01.910
Isshiki!

00:19:02.410 --> 00:19:04.420
Let me fight!

00:19:04.420 --> 00:19:06.170
I want to protect everyone too!

00:19:06.580 --> 00:19:07.540
Can I?

00:19:08.920 --> 00:19:09.670
Of course!

00:19:12.720 --> 00:19:14.930
That's your key!

00:19:15.590 --> 00:19:16.970
My key?

00:19:17.350 --> 00:19:18.140
Here we go!

00:19:18.140 --> 00:19:19.720
Operation start!

00:19:22.980 --> 00:19:24.270
Ignition!

00:19:26.860 --> 00:19:30.110
Texture on!

00:20:09.650 --> 00:20:11.860
Whoa! I can fly!

00:20:12.820 --> 00:20:14.610
Let's go, Wakaba!

00:20:29.500 --> 00:20:31.010
It changed!

00:20:32.260 --> 00:20:34.260
I guess you're looking for a fight!

00:20:34.510 --> 00:20:36.550
Akane, it's Docking time!

00:20:36.550 --> 00:20:37.890
Docking?

00:20:37.890 --> 00:20:38.760
Wakaba!

00:20:40.140 --> 00:20:41.770
Okay, Akane!

00:20:42.270 --> 00:20:43.390
Operation...

00:20:44.270 --> 00:20:45.940
Vividgreen!

00:21:15.680 --> 00:21:18.470
Vividgreen Operation!

00:21:21.390 --> 00:21:25.100
Vividblade, release safety!

00:21:26.980 --> 00:21:28.900
Energizing actuator!

00:21:30.150 --> 00:21:32.320
Output 140%!

00:21:35.110 --> 00:21:36.820
160%!

00:21:36.820 --> 00:21:38.580
180%!

00:21:39.200 --> 00:21:42.080
Engine critical limit at 200%!

00:21:44.000 --> 00:21:48.540
Vividblade, final operation!

00:21:58.260 --> 00:22:00.060
Thank God!

00:22:09.270 --> 00:22:12.070
From now on, you're our comrade, Wakaba!

00:22:12.610 --> 00:22:16.450
Please take good care of my crazy sister.

00:22:16.740 --> 00:22:18.450
S-So cute!

00:22:20.370 --> 00:22:21.620
N-Never mind!

00:22:21.950 --> 00:22:24.080
You're making me blush!

00:22:24.080 --> 00:22:27.080
I doubt she meant you, Gramps.

00:22:27.080 --> 00:22:28.210
She didn't?

00:22:29.670 --> 00:22:31.630
You're cute, too.

00:22:31.630 --> 00:22:34.970
You're such a good girl, Aoi.

00:24:14.200 --> 00:24:17.410
Shinomiya Himawari. No need to remember it.

00:24:17.660 --> 00:24:19.080
I'm not even coming to school.

00:24:19.830 --> 00:24:21.870
Still, those girls...

00:24:22.370 --> 00:24:24.000
Next time - Promise.

00:24:24.330 --> 00:24:26.920
She said she'd be back...
